# Production API origin. MUST stay on the same registrable domain as the
# SPA (bonbox.dk) so auth cookies are Domain=.bonbox.dk / SameSite=Lax and
# the strict CSRF double-submit check in the backend enforces. Pointing this
# at a different host (e.g. *.onrender.com) forces SameSite=None cookies and
# was the latent CSRF gap fixed in the Jun-2026 leak sweep. The live Vercel
# deploy already overrides this with api.bonbox.dk — this file now matches.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.bonbox.dk/api
